<!-- LAYOUT CONTRACT
     LEGEND    x=40..300
     AMBIENT   x=40..300 (below legend; clears skip bus)
     LEFT      x=400..720 — skip / create-only / ENDs
     SPINE     x=780..1160 — gate → create path
     RIGHT     x=1260..1640 — status lifecycle region

     BUSES (exclusive; miss every solid vertex AABB):
       x=350   skip → END drain (west gutter)
       x=1190  intent → backlog (spine|region gutter)
       x=1230  create → backlog climb (spine|region gutter; ≥40 from 1190)
       x=1700  progress → blocked (east only)

     Chips sit OFF spine centerline (east side of inter-node gaps).
     Status children inset ≥40px; blocked INSIDE the dashed frame.
     No mid-stroke edge labels — chips only.
-->
